{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12175","headline":"山居新种花药与道土同游赋诗 · 钱起","name":"山居新种花药与道土同游赋诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"自乐鱼鸟性，宁求农牧资。\n浅深爱岩壑，疏凿尽幽奇。\n雨花相助好，莺鸣春草时。\n种兰入山翠，引葛上花枝。\n风露拆红紫，缘溪复映池。\n新泉香杜若，片石引江蓠。\n宛谓武陵洞，潜鹰造化移。\n杖策携烟客，满袖掇芳蕤。\n蝴蝶舞留我，仙鸡闲傍篱。\n但令黄精熟，不虑韶光迟。\n笑指云萝迳，樵人那得知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12175.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12175","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}